WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.554 --> 00:00:11.332
Sign in as the business owner.

2
00:00:11.432 --> 00:00:17.401
Open System, then Settings. The list on the left holds every section, grouped by what it does.

3
00:00:20.343 --> 00:00:25.543
Business holds your trading name, legal name, phone, email, website and address.

4
00:00:26.845 --> 00:00:31.661
These details appear on your receipts and invoices, so keep them current.

5
00:00:32.388 --> 00:00:36.325
Money & tax sets your currency and your default tax rate.

6
00:00:37.627 --> 00:00:42.994
Tax registration, the default rate and whether prices include tax are all set here.

7
00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:49.801
Receipt template controls what a printed receipt looks like: paper size, header and footer text.

8
00:00:50.903 --> 00:00:56.930
Switches choose what to print, such as the logo, customer, cashier, tax breakdown or a barcode.

9
00:00:58.861 --> 00:01:03.513
Cashier (POS) and Payments hold the checkout rules for your registers.

10
00:01:03.613 --> 00:01:08.923
Some options open their own pages: Payment Methods, Loyalty points and Gift cards.

11
00:01:09.024 --> 00:01:15.053
Messaging has email and SMS settings and templates. Daily summary sends you a recap of the day.

12
00:01:15.153 --> 00:01:20.463
That is Settings. Change a section, then use Save settings at the top to apply it.
